# Jak 3: Daxter's second section in the war factory (LIST-0.1.9 item 13; a tester: "i think there is a effect missing at
# crimson bot factory jak3 daxter section 2nd time you play as daxter in robot facility"). Run with
# JAKVR_TEST_CONTINUE=factory-indax-2 JAKVR_TEST_WARP=generic-spot-shadow-effect QUEST_SIM_ALIGN=10000
# JAKVR_SHADOW_EYES=1 JAKVR_STATE_TRACE=1, then again with JAKVR_SHADOW_ZPASS=1 (the shadows counted as the flat game
# counts them): a new game into play (as jak3_shadow_walk.sim), the section's continue, Daxter put 2 m from the nearest
# zapper's red glow (fac-zapper's hilite, a spot shadow lightening the floor along its beam) at frame 10000. Then a
# picture each way round (the head turned 0, 90, 180 and 270 degrees) four times over the zapper's on and off (about
# 1.85 s each), and looking down. Expect the beam and its red glow on the floor in both eyes, the same in both runs.
# A (Cross) every 200 frames from 3100 to 4500 closes the new game's save notice (it hid the view in sim pg).
# 0.1.9 (sim s09 fd): the continue starts Daxter hanging from a ledge; the warp takes him from there (build 126) and A
# at 10002 lets him drop (standing, a jump).
